Electron adaptation notes (44-x-y):
skia/config/SkUserConfig.h on this branch lacks the surrounding SK_SUPPORT_LEGACY_GRAPHITE_RRECT_BLUR / SK_DISABLE_GRAPHITE_NONINTEGRAL_VARYINGS_FLAT_INTERPOLATION defines; the define is placed after the branch's last legacy define. This pick exists only so that the following 'Remove SK_LEGACY_ALPHA_RUNS' pick applies as upstream; the net effect on the file is no define.

